{"id":"gmr9r19q616s206sdnhsnoj6v","title":"有研硅员工刘冰因内幕交易被北京证监局处罚67万余元","originalTitle":"聚餐后“精准”卖股票 被罚没超67万元","summary":"北京证监局处罚有研硅员工刘冰内幕交易案，没收违法所得7.1万元并罚款60万元，合计67.1万元。经查，刘冰在2025年5月16日晚与内幕知情人聚餐后，于次日通过A、B、C三个账户及国泰海通、华泰证券账户精准抛售公司股票，规避损失达7.1万元。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"东方财富"},"links":{"original":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1354,202611123929807514.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T12:18:18.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T13:52:24.903Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T13:52:24.903Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚"],"score":77,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"168e4587-ac7d-4dca-a696-883e1f9a890f","title":"有研硅员工内幕交易案遭67万元罚没"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"168e4587-ac7d-4dca-a696-883e1f9a890f","title":"有研硅员工内幕交易案遭67万元罚没"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fKyDVZouf_Is","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}